2Sa 2:1 , David, by God's direction, with his company goes up to Hebron, where he is made king of Judah;
2Sa 2:5 , He commends them of Jabesh-gilead for their kindness to Saul;
2Sa 2:8 , Abner makes Ishbosheth king of Israel;
2Sa 2:12 , A mortal skirmish between twelve of Abner's and twelve of Joab's men;
2Sa 2:18 , Asahel is slain;
2Sa 2:25 , At Abner's motion, Joab sounds a retreat;
2Sa 2:32 , Asahel's burial.
